# Frontend Rules

- Use Next.js App Router conventions.
- Prefer Server Components.
- Use "use client" only when browser interactivity requires it.
- Follow `docs/DESIGN.md`.
- Use documented design tokens.
- Keep components accessible and keyboard usable.
- Optimize product and editorial imagery.
- Preserve the editorial sneaker-commerce visual language.
